WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:07.501
Migration shows whether your records would load into the new system, and what to fix first.

2
00:00:07.501 --> 00:00:12.414
The banner gives the current verdict from the latest analysis.

3
00:00:12.414 --> 00:00:18.404
Workbook from the new system: fill the new system's own workbook from a finished SuccessFactors run.

4
00:00:18.404 --> 00:00:23.412
Three steps: choose the run and workbook, check what fits, export the data.

5
00:00:23.412 --> 00:00:28.322
Choose the workbook file (.xlsx) the new system gave you.

6
00:00:28.322 --> 00:00:33.669
Check the workbook only reads it. Nothing is stored and nothing is exported yet.

7
00:00:33.669 --> 00:00:50.273
After a check: how many rows are ready, how many are held back, and how many sheets can be filled.

8
00:00:50.273 --> 00:01:04.895
Required columns with no data are named, because the new system refuses those rows.

9
00:01:04.895 --> 00:01:10.224
Gaps by kind: why records would not load, grouped by the kind of problem.
